		"name": "Game Backend API - Modul 8",
		"description": "Postman Workspace Collection untuk pengujian Game Backend REST API (Node.js, Express.js & SQLite) mencakup Health Check, Auth Register/Login (Bcrypt & JWT), serta Score Management (Update Score, View Score per User, Top 10 Leaderboard).",
